                                                "sense_id": "62796785-a18c-3c30-968a-fec74acad476",
                                                "text": "I feel thy power […] to trace the ways / Of highest agents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "749dcab0-847d-4d92-866f-e992cb649dc2",
